            {
              "name": "post_text",
              "value": "🌅 Good morning, LinkedIn community!\n\nStarting the week with some motivation: Success isn't just about what you accomplish in your life, it's about what you inspire others to do.\n\n💡 Today's focus:\n• Setting clear goals\n• Taking actionable steps\n• Supporting team members\n• Celebrating small wins\n\nWhat's your main focus for this week? Share in the comments! 👇\n\n#MondayMotivation #Leadership #TeamWork #Goals #Success #LinkedInCommunity"
            },
            {
              "name": "organization_name",
              "value": "Your Company Name"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2b3c4d5e-text-content",
      "name": "Prepare Text Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.linkedin.com/v2/organizations",
